{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/7384c85e34866717146e0ff2d6364098.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1082 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>8+ cars</strong> in an intense death race, where <strong>YOU</strong> drive to <strong>SURVIVE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>armour</strong>, <strong>health</strong>, <strong>nitro</strong> and <strong>ammo</strong> EVERY checkpoint! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you mess up, you might just <strong>blow up</strong> on the battlefield!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling race with <strong>your life</strong> on the line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.poster.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.webm?t=1772511867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.mp4?t=1772511867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/ab1795953c3b1c032dec1aafbe128bf9.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1082 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the chaos and dominate in high-intensity arena combat where strategy and aggression decide everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other cars inside an circular arena, where your decision making and skill can keep you the last person standing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.poster.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.webm?t=1772511867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.mp4?t=1772511867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/ae8922c8bd2f02afe580714bc7d9ad83.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1082 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose among <strong>10+ cars</strong> (we keep adding new ones)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your cars with <strong>different colours</strong> to stand out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix-match <strong>various weapons</strong>, to find your optimal combo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/411a03db4c7728b0ae7f4e618555b5a3.poster.avif?t=1772511867\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/411a03db4c7728b0ae7f4e618555b5a3.webm?t=1772511867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/411a03db4c7728b0ae7f4e618555b5a3.mp4?t=1772511867\" type=\"vide